Scriptname IVDTSoundsScript extends ReferenceAlias
{This holds all of the sounds for an IVDT scene that are not tied to a voice.
Values are AudioUtil names: voice-category resolution falls back to the
[sfx] table in AudioUtil.toml, where these map to Sound\fx\IVDT\Sounds\.}

